package com.example.sma.data

import com.example.sma.R
import com.example.sma.ui.Multimedia

val multimediaList = listOf(Multimedia(1, R.drawable.aot, "Attack On Titan", true, true, "⭐10", "Anime", "Episodes:", "89", 2013, "Action, Drama, Suspense", "Attack on Titan is a dark fantasy anime series set in a world where humanity is on the brink of extinction, forced to live within cities surrounded by giant walls to protect themselves from Titans, monstrous humanoids that devour humans. The story follows Eren Yeager and his friends, Mikasa Ackerman and Armin Arlert, as they join the military to fight the Titans after their hometown is destroyed and Eren's mother is eaten."),
    Multimedia(2, R.drawable.bb, "Breaking Bad", false,false, "⭐9.5", "TV Show", "Episodes:", "62",2008, "Tragedy, Crime, Dark Comedy", "Breaking Bad is a critically acclaimed American television drama series about Walter White, a high school chemistry teacher who, after being diagnosed with terminal lung cancer, turns to manufacturing and selling methamphetamine with his former student, Jesse Pinkman, to secure his family's financial future. The series, set in Albuquerque, New Mexico, explores Walter's transformation from a mild-mannered teacher into a ruthless drug kingpin, and the impact of his choices on his family, relationships, and himself"),
    Multimedia(3, R.drawable.oppen, "Oppenheimer", false,false, "⭐8.3", "Movie", "Duration:", "3h", 2023, "Drama, Biography, Historical Epic", "The film explores Oppenheimer's (played by Cillian Murphy) early academic career, his leadership at Los Alamos in creating the first nuclear weapons, and the moral and political consequences of his work. It delves into his internal conflict over the destructive power of the bomb, his relationships with colleagues and government officials, and his eventual fall from grace during the Red Scare due to suspicions about his communist ties."),
    Multimedia(4, R.drawable.one_piece, "One Piece", false,false, "⭐9.0", "Anime", "Episodes:", "1133 (Currently Airing)", 1999, "Action, Adventure, Fantasy", "One Piece follows Monkey D. Luffy, a young man whose body gained rubber-like properties after unintentionally eating a Devil Fruit. He assembles a crew, the Straw Hat Pirates, and embarks on a grand adventure to find the legendary treasure called \"One Piece\" and become the next King of the Pirates. The series is set in a world of pirates, monsters, and vast seas, where Luffy and his crew face numerous challenges, form alliances, and unravel the mysteries of the world while pursuing their dreams."),
    Multimedia(5, R.drawable.got, "Game of Thrones", true,false, "⭐9.2", "TV Show", "Episodes:", "73", 2011, "Fantasy Epic, Action, Tragedy", "The story is set on the fictional continents of Westeros and Essos, where noble families vie for control of the Iron Throne, the seat of power in the Seven Kingdoms of Westeros. Meanwhile, an ancient supernatural threat—the White Walkers—looms in the frozen north, and a deposed queen, Daenerys Targaryen, seeks to reclaim her birthright across the Narrow Sea."),
    Multimedia(6, R.drawable.wow, "The Wolf of Wall Street", true,false, "⭐8.2", "Movie", "Duration:", "3h",2013, "Dark Comedy, Satire, Comedy", "Jordan Belfort (DiCaprio) is Long Island penny stockbroker who serves almost two years in prison for refusing to co-operate in a huge 1990s securities fraud case that involved widespread corruption on Wall Street and in the corporate banking world, including mob infiltration."),
    Multimedia(7, R.drawable.bleach, "Bleach", false,false, "⭐8.2", "Anime", "Episodes:", "366", 2004, "Action, Adventure, Supernatural", "Bleach follows Ichigo Kurosaki, a teenager who gains the powers of a Soul Reaper (a death god) after encountering Rukia Kuchiki, a Soul Reaper who protects humans from evil spirits called Hollows. Ichigo takes on Rukia's duties, defending humans and guiding lost souls to the afterlife. The series explores his journey as he battles Hollows, navigates the world of Soul Reapers, and confronts various enemies, including the Soul Society, a hidden realm of Soul Reapers."),
    Multimedia(8, R.drawable.twd, "The Walking Dead", false,false, "⭐8.1", "TV Show", "Episodes:", "177", 2010, "Zombie Horror, Drama, Thriller", "The Walking Dead is a post-apocalyptic horror series centered on a group of survivors led by Sheriff's Deputy Rick Grimes, as they navigate a world overrun by zombies (referred to as \"walkers\"). The series explores themes of survival, resilience, and the challenges of rebuilding society amidst constant threats, both from the undead and from other living groups."),
    Multimedia(9, R.drawable.inception, "Inception", true, true, "⭐8.8", "Movie", "Duration:", "2h 28m", 2010, "Action, Adventure, Sci-Fi Epic", "Dom Cobb is a thief with the rare ability to steal secrets from the unconscious, obtained during the state of sleep. Prevented from returning to his family, he is given the opportunity to redeem himself by performing a seemingly impossible task: planting an idea in the mind of the heir to an empire. To carry out the perfect crime, he counts on the help of his partner Arthur, the discreet Eames and the dream architect Ariadne. Together, they run so that the enemy does not anticipate their steps."),
    Multimedia(10, R.drawable.dbz, "Dragon Ball Z",false,false, "⭐8.8", "Anime", "Episodes:", "291", 1996, "Action, Adventure, Fantasy", "Dragon Ball Z follows the adventures of an adult Son Goku as he defends Earth against various villains. These villains include powerful space warriors, dangerous androids, and magical creatures. The series explores Goku's relationships with his son Gohan, his rivalry with Vegeta, and the ongoing battles to protect Earth"),
    Multimedia(11, R.drawable.the_boys, "The Boys",false,false, "⭐8.6", "TV Show", "Episodes:", "32", 2019, "Superhero, Action, Comedy", "The Boys is a superhero satire series that flips the typical narrative by portraying superheroes as arrogant, corrupt celebrities controlled by a powerful corporation, Vought International. The series follows two main groups: The Boys, a group of vigilantes seeking revenge against these corrupt \"Supes,\" and a group of \"Supes\" known as The Seven. The series explores themes of power, corruption, and the dark side of celebrity culture."),
    Multimedia(12, R.drawable.prestige, "The Prestige", true,false, "⭐8.5", "Movie", "Duration:", "2h 10m", 2006, "Drama, Tragedy, Mystery", "In 19th century London, two illusionist and magician friends, Alfred Borden and Rupert Angier, end up building a rivalry, a battle for supremacy, which extends over the years and turns into an obsession, the results of which will inevitably be tragic."),
    Multimedia(13, R.drawable.naruto, "Naruto",true, true, "⭐8.4", "Anime", "Episodes:", "220", 2002, "Action, Adventure, Fantasy", "Naruto is a Japanese manga and anime series following the story of Naruto Uzumaki, a young ninja who dreams of becoming the Hokage, the leader of his village, Konohagakure. Orphaned at birth and ostracized by the villagers who see him as the Nine-Tailed Fox spirit that attacked their village, Naruto strives for recognition and acceptance while training to become a powerful ninja. The series follows Naruto's journey as he forms bonds with his teammates, Sasuke Uchiha and Sakura Haruno, and his teacher Kakashi Hatake, navigating challenges, facing enemies, and ultimately shaping his destiny."),
    Multimedia(14, R.drawable.peaky_blinders, "Peaky Blinders",true,false, "⭐8.7", "TV Show", "Episodes:", "36", 2013, "Crime, Drama, Gangster", "Peaky Blinders\" is a historical crime drama set in post-World War I Birmingham, England, following the Shelby family, a Romani/Irish Traveller gang known as the Peaky Blinders. The series follows their ambitious leader, Tommy Shelby, as he expands their criminal empire while battling rival gangs, the police, and other powerful figures. The series explores themes of family, ambition, loyalty, and the consequences of violence in a rapidly changing post-war Britain."),
    Multimedia(15, R.drawable.titanic, "Titanic",false,false, "⭐7.9", "Movie", "Duration:", "3h 14m", 1997, "Romance, Tragedy, Drama", "A poor artist and a wealthy young woman meet and fall in love on the fateful maiden voyage of the Titanic in 1912. Although she is engaged to the arrogant heirs of a steel mill, the young woman defies her family and friends in search of true love."),
    Multimedia(16, R.drawable.mha, "My Hero Academia", true,false, "⭐8.2", "Anime", "Episodes:", "159", 2016, "Superhero, Action, Fantasy", "My Hero Academia is set in a world where most people possess superpowers called \"Quirks\". The story follows Izuku Midoriya, a boy born without a Quirk, who dreams of becoming a hero. After an encounter with the world's greatest hero, All Might, Izuku inherits his Quirk, \"One For All,\" and is accepted into the prestigious hero academy, U.A. High. He trains to become a hero, facing challenges and villains along the way, while learning what it truly means to be a hero."),
    Multimedia(17, R.drawable.stranger_things, "Stranger Things",false,false, "⭐8.6", "TV Show", "Episodes:", "34",2016, "Dark Fantasy, Monster Horror, Sci-Fi Epic", "Stranger Things is a science fiction horror drama set in the 1980s in the fictional town of Hawkins, Indiana. The story revolves around the disappearance of a young boy named Will Byers, which is just the beginning of a series of strange and supernatural events plaguing the town. A group of young friends, along with a psychokinetic girl named Eleven who has escaped from a government lab, investigate the unsettling occurrences and uncover a dangerous alternate dimension called the Upside Down, inhabited by monstrous creatures. The series explores themes of friendship, family, and courage as the characters confront these supernatural threats and the secrets of Hawkins National Laboratory."),
    Multimedia(18, R.drawable.matrix, "The Matrix",false,false, "⭐8.7", "Movie", "Duration:", "2h 16m", 1999, "Martial Arts, Sci-Fi Epic, Cyberpunk", "Young programmer Thomas Anderson is plagued by strange nightmares in which he is constantly connected by cables to a vast computer system from the future. As the dream repeats itself, he begins to distrust reality. Thomas meets the mysterious Morpheus and Trinity and discovers that he is the victim of an intelligent and artificial system called the Matrix, which manipulates people's minds and creates the illusion of a real world while using individuals' brains and bodies to produce energy."),
    Multimedia(19, R.drawable.black_clover, "Black Clover",true,true, "⭐8.2", "Anime", "Episodes:", "170", 2017, "Action, Fantasy, Adventure", "Black Clover follows Asta, a young boy born without magic in a world where magic is everything, as he strives to become the Wizard King, the strongest mage in the Clover Kingdom. Despite his disadvantage, Asta's determination and the power of a five-leaf clover grimoire allow him to compete with his magically gifted rival, Yuno, and other powerful mages."),
    Multimedia(20, R.drawable.dexter, "Dexter",false,false, "⭐8.6", "TV Show", "Episodes:", "96", 2006, "Crime, Drama, Psychological Drama", "Dexter is a crime drama series about Dexter Morgan, a blood spatter analyst for the Miami Metro Police Department who also leads a double life as a vigilante serial killer. He only targets other murderers who have escaped justice, following a strict moral code instilled in him by his adoptive father. The show explores Dexter's internal struggle with his dark urges, his relationships with his sister Debra and others, and his efforts to conceal his secret life."),
    Multimedia(21, R.drawable.johnwick, "John Wick", true,false, "⭐7.5", "Movie", "Duration:", "1h 41m", 2014, "Action, Crime, Thriller", "John Wick is a retired hitman, dealing with the grief of losing the great love of his life. When a gangster breaks into his home, kills his dog and steals his car, he is forced back into action and begins his revenge."),
    Multimedia(22, R.drawable.kny, "Demon Slayer",false,false, "⭐8.6", "Anime", "Episodes:", "63", 2019, "Action, Fantasy, Animation", "Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba tells the story of Tanjiro Kamado, a young boy who becomes a demon slayer after his family is slaughtered and his younger sister, Nezuko, is turned into a demon. He embarks on a perilous journey to avenge his family and find a way to turn Nezuko back into a human. Along the way, he battles demons and hones his skills as a swordsman, joining the Demon Slayer Corps."),
    Multimedia(23, R.drawable.severance, "Severance",false,false, "⭐8.7", "TV Show", "Episodes:", "19", 2022, "Conspiracy Thriller, Workplace Drama, Dystopian Sci-Fi", "Severance is a psychological thriller series where employees of Lumon Industries undergo a procedure called \"severance\" that surgically separates their work and personal memories. This creates two distinct personas: \"innies,\" who only exist within the confines of Lumon, and \"outies,\" who live their lives outside of work with no knowledge of their innie counterparts. The show follows Mark, the leader of a severed team, as he and his colleagues navigate the strange and often sinister world of Lumon, uncovering secrets about their jobs and the company itself."),
    Multimedia(24, R.drawable.gladiador, "Gladiator",true,false, "⭐8.5", "Movie", "Duration:", "2h 35m", 2000, "Action, Adventure, Drama", "Maximus is a powerful Roman general, beloved by the people and Emperor Marcus Aurelius. Before his death, the emperor arouses the wrath of his son Commodus by making public his preference for leaving the throne to Maximus. Thirsty for power, Commodus kills his father, assumes the crown and orders the death of Maximus, who manages to escape before being caught, and goes into hiding as a slave and gladiator while seeking revenge."),
    Multimedia(25, R.drawable.jjk, "Jujutsu Kaisen",true,false, "⭐8.5", "Anime", "Episodes:", "47", 2020, "Action, Animation, Supernatural", "Jujutsu Kaisen is a dark fantasy anime and manga series where high school student Yuji Itadori becomes a Jujutsu sorcerer after consuming a powerful cursed object. He joins a secret organization to combat curses and eliminate the King of Curses, Ryomen Sukuna, whose finger he ingested. The story follows Yuji's journey as he hones his jujutsu skills and fights against cursed spirits while also battling Sukuna's influence."),
    Multimedia(26, R.drawable.bcs, "Better Call Saul", false,false, "⭐9.0", "TV Show", "Episodes:", "63", 2015, "Drug Crime, Epic, Tragedy", "Better Call Saul is a spin-off prequel to Breaking Bad, following Jimmy McGill, a struggling lawyer who eventually becomes the morally compromised Saul Goodman, Walter White's lawyer. The series explores Jimmy's transformation, his relationships, and his descent into the criminal world, set primarily in Albuquerque, New Mexico, years before the events of Breaking Bad. It also features Mike Ehrmantraut, a former police officer who becomes a fixer for criminals, and his own moral decline as he gets drawn into the drug trade."),
    Multimedia(27, R.drawable.schindler, "Schindler's List",true, true, "⭐9.0", "Movie", "Duration:", "3h 15m", 1993, "Tragedy, Drama, Biography", "Steven Spielberg's \"Schindler's List\" tells the true story of Oskar Schindler, a German businessman who initially profits from the war but later saves Jews from the Holocaust. Shot in black and white in Poland, the film is one of the director's most intense works, having won seven Oscars, including Best Picture and Director. Liam Neeson, Ben Kingsley and Ralph Fiennes (who gained 30 pounds for the role) shine in the cast. Interestingly, Martin Scorsese turned down directing the project, thinking a Jewish filmmaker would do a better job."),
    Multimedia(28, R.drawable.solo_leveling, "Solo Leveling",false,false, "⭐8.6", "Anime", "Episodes:", "25", 2024, "Survival, Action, Adventure", "Solo Leveling tells the story of Sung Jinwoo, the world's weakest hunter, who gains the ability to level up through a mysterious program called the System after a near-fatal experience in a dungeon. He embarks on a journey to uncover the secrets of the System, the dungeons, and his newfound powers, fighting against powerful monsters and other hunters. His goal is to become strong enough to protect his family and understand the origins of the supernatural forces that threaten humanity."),
    Multimedia(29, R.drawable.greys_anatomy, "Grey's Anatomy",false,false, "⭐7.6", "TV Show", "Episodes:", "448", 2005, "Romance, Drama, Soap Opera", "Grey's Anatomy is a medical drama series that follows the personal and professional lives of surgical interns, residents, and attendings at Grey Sloan Memorial Hospital (formerly Seattle Grace Hospital) in Seattle. The show centers on the journey of Meredith Grey, a surgical intern, as she navigates the challenges of her career and relationships with fellow doctors. The series explores themes of love, loss, ambition, and the complexities of human connection against the backdrop of high-stakes medical cases."),
    Multimedia(30, R.drawable.interstellar, "Interstellar",true,false, "⭐8.7", "Movie", "Duration:", "2h 49m", 2014, "Quest, Adventure, Drama", "Earth's natural reserves are running out and a group of astronauts are tasked with checking out potential planets to host the world's population, enabling the continuation of the species. Cooper is called to lead the group and accepts the mission knowing that he will never see his children again. Alongside Brand, Jenkins and Doyle, he will continue in search of a new home.")
)